Regenerate after changing a source:  tools/gen-basemap.py
Verify the outputs are current:     tools/gen-basemap.py --check

Format: "NEBM" v1, little endian — 4s magic, u8 version, u8 kind (0 polygon,
1 line, 2 point), u8 reserved, i32 min_lon/min_lat/max_lon/max_lat in 1e-4
degrees, u32 part_count, u32 point_count, then part_count * (u32 offset,
u32 length) into a point array of (i32 lon, i32 lat). 1e-4 degrees is ~11 m.
